      "checkedAt": "2026-10-29",
      "notes": [
        "REST ids are numbers; GraphQL returns gids (gid://shopify/<Type>/<n>), converted with gid-number.",
        "GraphQL DateTime values are UTC ISO 8601 (2026-10-01T14:08:14Z); REST returned the shop time zone offset (2026-10-01T10:08:14-04:00). Same instant, different string.",
        "Address fields come from Shop.shopAddress (the REST reference names ShopAddress; Shop.billingAddress is the deprecated alias).",
        "currency and country_code are GraphQL enums whose values are the same ISO codes REST returned, so they are not converted.",
        "Not mapped: plan_name (the REST reference names no GraphQL field), timezone (GraphQL timezoneAbbreviation is \"EST\", REST is \"(GMT-05:00) Eastern Time\"), weight_unit (GraphQL enum POUNDS vs REST \"lb\"), country (REST returns the code, GraphQL ShopAddress.country the name), money_in_emails_format.",
        "tax_shipping is left out: GraphQL Shop.taxShipping is a Boolean while @shopify/shopify-api declares the REST field a string."
      ]
    },
