        "quote": "[/admin/api/latest/products.​json?ids=632910392,921728736](https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-rest/latest/resources/product.md#get-products?ids=632910392,921728736)\n\nRetrieve a list of products\n\n[products](https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/queries/products?example=retrieve-a-list-of-products)"
      },
      "graphql": {
        "url": "https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/2026-01/queries/products",
        "quote": "Retrieves a list of [products](https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/objects/Product) in a store."
      },
      "checkedAt": "2026-10-29",
      "notes": [
        "REST ids are numbers; GraphQL returns gids (gid://shopify/<Type>/<n>), converted with gid-number.",
        "GraphQL DateTime values are UTC ISO 8601 (2026-10-01T14:08:14Z); REST returned the shop time zone offset (2026-10-01T10:08:14-04:00). Same instant, different string.",
        "status is a GraphQL enum (ACTIVE, ARCHIVED, DRAFT, UNLISTED), lowercased to the REST value; UNLISTED has no REST value in the 2025-01 reference.",
        "tags is a list in GraphQL, joined with \", \" to rebuild the REST comma-separated string.",
        "variants and images are truncated at 250 nodes; REST returned the full lists.",
        "Variant price and compare_at_price are the GraphQL Money scalar (a decimal string); REST 2025-01 returned a decimal string too, but trailing-zero formatting is not documented as identical.",
        "Variant sku is read from inventoryItem.sku, the field the REST reference names for it (ProductVariant.sku also exists).",
        "images is Product.images, deprecated in GraphQL in favour of media (the REST reference points at Product.media); only src -> url is mapped.",
        "REST status and published_status default to any; GraphQL products without a query returns every product too. Other REST filters (ids, vendor, since_id, collection_id, ...) have no argument mapping here."
      ]
    },
