      "notes": [
        "GraphQL productsCount is capped at 10000 by default (\"Use `null` to have no limit.\"); REST returned the exact count. The adapter should pass limit: null.",
        "REST filters (vendor, product_type, published_status, ...) have no argument mapping here.",
        "Sends limit: null, because the count otherwise stops at 10,000 while REST returned the exact number."
